        <div class="prose "><p class="subheading">About the SKYTRAK ST+</p><h2 class="h2"><span class="text-gradient " style="--gradient: linear-gradient(228deg, rgba(30, 48, 4, 1) 14%, rgba(0, 10, 0, 1) 48.561%, rgba(61, 96, 7, 1) 83%)">The SKYTRAK ST+ is a cutting-edge golf launch monitor that offers unmatched accuracy in its class</span></h2><p>Incorporating a dual doppler radar system and proprietary machine learning software to provide golfers with precise club and ball data, taking game improvement to the next level.</p></div>
