      <path d="m7.714 13.071 3.116 3.215c1.468-4.214 2.688-6.062 5.455-8.572" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg></div><div class="text-with-icons__text-wrapper">
                <div class="prose"><p class="h5">Improved Photometric Camera System for More Accuracy</p><p><span class="metafield-multi_line_text_field">The improved camera system gives golfers highly accurate and reliable ball-tracking data that can power a player’s practice and improvement. The camera system also provides for improved outdoor performance on mats. You can now work on your game at the range.</span></p></div>
              </div>
            </div><div
              id="block-template--26883993960754__text_with_icons_EiW9xt-item_RJByeA-2"
