    </svg></div><div class="text-with-icons__text-wrapper">
                <div class="prose"><p class="h5">Advanced Club Data with SKYTRAK ST+</p><p><span class="metafield-multi_line_text_field">The Doppler Radar System delivers useful club data, including: Club Head Speed, Smash Factor, Club Path and Face Angle. Additionally, applying proprietary machine-learning algorithms to that data delivers precision at a level matched only by the highest end launch monitors on the market.</span></p></div>
              </div>
            </div><div
              id="block-template--26883993960754__text_with_icons_EiW9xt-item_RJByeA-4"
