    </svg></div><div class="text-with-icons__text-wrapper">
                <div class="prose"><p class="h5">Shot Scoring To Measure Your Progress</p><p><span class="metafield-multi_line_text_field">The SKYTRAK Shot Optimizer feature allows you to determine the expected distance by hitting 20 shots with any club. This data measures subsequent shots and provides a Shot Score, which compares your performance against shots from other players of various skill levels. The Shot Score objectively measures your golfing ability and predicts your expected performance in an 18-hole round.</span></p></div>
