</section><section id="shopify-section-template--26883993960754__faq_7erXUC" class="shopify-section shopify-section--faq"><style>
  #shopify-section-template--26883993960754__faq_7erXUC {
    --section-background-hash: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-template--26883993960754__faq_7erXUC + * {
    --previous-section-background-hash: 0;
  }</style>
<style>
  #shopify-section-template--26883993960754__faq_7erXUC {
    --section-stack-intro: 50%;
    --section-stack-main: 50%;
  }
</style>

<div class="section 
  
  section-blends section-full">
  <div class="section-stack section-stack--horizontal "><div class="section-stack__intro">
        <div class="v-stack gap-10"><div class="prose "><p class="subheading">FAQ</p><h2 class="h2">Have a question ?</h2><p>If you have questions about this product, shipping and returns, or anything else SKYTRAK, reach out to one of our SIMP PROS.</p></div><div class="hidden lg:block"><div class="faq-availability"><div class="v-stack gap-4"><img src="//www.skytrakgolf.com/cdn/shop/files/team.png?v=1711678384&amp;width=320" alt="SKYTRAK golf sim support team" srcset="//www.skytrakgolf.com/cdn/shop/files/team.png?v=1711678384&amp;width=160 160w, //www.skytrakgolf.com/cdn/shop/files/team.png?v=1711678384&amp;width=320 320w" width="320" height="90" loading="lazy" style="max-width: 160px" sizes="160px"></div>
<a class="button button--xl"
  
  
  
  
  
  href="/pages/sim-pros"
  
  
 >Talk to a SIM PRO</a>
</div></div></div>
      </div><div class="section-stack__main">
        <div
          class="accordion-box rounded bg-secondary"
        ><details
  
  class=" accordion  group"
  aria-expanded="false"
  is="accordion-disclosure"
  
  
>
  <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><span
          
        >Is the SKYTRAK ST+ accurate?</span><span class="circle-chevron group-hover:colors group-expanded:colors group-expanded:rotate"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" width="8" height="6" class="icon icon-chevron-bottom-small" viewBox="0 0 8 6">
      <path d="m1 1.5 3 3 3-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
    </svg></span>
    </div>
  </summary>

  <div class="accordion__content"><div class="prose"><div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p>The SKYTRAK ST+ Launch Monitor is extremely accurate and provides a realistic depiction of actual ball flight within close proximity to other leading launch monitors and real world results. SKYTRAK has performed robot testing at Golf Laboratories, the golf industry’s #1 independent testing facility. Using a variety of shot types, ball speeds, and golf clubs, the measured results were virtually indistinguishable from the leading commercial launch monitors in the industry across the 5 most important parameters – ball speed, launch angle, back spin, side spin/spin axis, and side angle.</p><p>Unlike some professional-grade launch monitors, SKYTRAK&#39;s ball flight simulations are not affected by atmospheric conditions like wind, humidity, etc. (unless you turn these on in the session settings). With the addition of doppler radar to the SKYTRAK ST+ to combine with the improved high-speed photometric camera system, you can trust the accuracy of this launch monitor both indoors and outdoors.</p></div></div></div>
</details>
<details
  
  class=" accordion  group"
  aria-expanded="false"
  is="accordion-disclosure"
  
  
>
  <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><span
          
        >Is a subscription required to use all features?</span><span class="circle-chevron group-hover:colors group-expanded:colors group-expanded:rotate"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" width="8" height="6" class="icon icon-chevron-bottom-small" viewBox="0 0 8 6">
      <path d="m1 1.5 3 3 3-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
    </svg></span>
    </div>
  </summary>

  <div class="accordion__content"><div class="prose"><div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p>Yes. SKYTRAK includes basic features for free, but many advanced tools - like Course Play and Game Improvement features require a paid SKYTRAK Membership (Essential, Core, or Elite). Each tier unlocks more features<a href="https://skytrakgolf.com/pages/membership" title="membership"> click here to learn more</a>!</p></div></div></div>
</details>
<details
  
  class=" accordion  group"
  aria-expanded="false"
  is="accordion-disclosure"
  
  
>
  <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><span
          
        >What space do I need for a SKYTRAK Golf Simulator Studio at home?</span><span class="circle-chevron group-hover:colors group-expanded:colors group-expanded:rotate"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" width="8" height="6" class="icon icon-chevron-bottom-small" viewBox="0 0 8 6">
      <path d="m1 1.5 3 3 3-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
    </svg></span>
    </div>
  </summary>

  <div class="accordion__content"><div class="prose"><div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p>To set up a SKYTRAK golf simulator studio, ensure your space allows for a full unrestricted swing. SKYTRAKs design minimizes the need for extensive space behind the tee, but sufficient room is still necessary for comfortable play. </p><p><strong>Studio Dimensions:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Studio 8&#39;</strong>: 8 ft (W) x 7 ft 5 in (H) x 4 ft (D)</li><li><strong>Studio 10&#39;</strong>: 10 ft (W) x 8 ft 6 in (H) x 5 ft 4 in (D)</li><li><strong>Studio 12&#39;</strong>: 12 ft (W) x 8 ft 6 in (H) x 5 ft 4 in (D)</li><li><strong>Studio 13&#39; Deep</strong>: 13 ft (W) x 10 ft (H) x 10 ft (D)</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Considerations:</strong></p><ul><li>Practice Swings: before setting up take practice swings in the intended space to ensure you can swing comfortably </li><li>Left - and Right - Handed Golfers: If multiple players will use the simulator, consider adding extra width to accommodate different swing directions</li></ul></div></div></div>
</details>
<details
  
  class=" accordion  group"
  aria-expanded="false"
  is="accordion-disclosure"
  
  
>
  <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><span
          
        >Usable environments &amp; compatible devices</span><span class="circle-chevron group-hover:colors group-expanded:colors group-expanded:rotate"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" width="8" height="6" class="icon icon-chevron-bottom-small" viewBox="0 0 8 6">
      <path d="m1 1.5 3 3 3-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
    </svg></span>
    </div>
  </summary>

  <div class="accordion__content"><div class="prose"><div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p>This launch monitor can be used both indoors and outdoors. Please note for the full suite of features; you would need to be connected to the internet.</p><p>Both launch monitors are compatible with PC, iOS, Andorid devices. However, be sure to also match the your device needs to the software option that you intend to use with this launch monitor.</p></div></div></div>
</details>
<details
  
  class=" accordion  group"
  aria-expanded="false"
  is="accordion-disclosure"
  
  
>
  <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><span
          
        >How do I measure my room for a golf simulator studio?</span><span class="circle-chevron group-hover:colors group-expanded:colors group-expanded:rotate"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" width="8" height="6" class="icon icon-chevron-bottom-small" viewBox="0 0 8 6">
      <path d="m1 1.5 3 3 3-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
    </svg></span>
    </div>
  </summary>

  <div class="accordion__content"><div class="prose"><div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p>In order to fit a SKYTRAK Golf Simulator Studio in your home you will need a space that is at least 8&#39; (W) X 7&#39;5 (H) X 4&#39; (D) <strong>(space requirements are variable based on player - must be able to comfortably swing a golf club in the space).</strong></p></div></div></div>
</details>
<details
  
  class=" accordion  group"
  aria-expanded="false"
  is="accordion-disclosure"
  
  
>
  <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><span
          
        >What is the SKYTRAK ST+ network password?</span><span class="circle-chevron group-hover:colors group-expanded:colors group-expanded:rotate"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" width="8" height="6" class="icon icon-chevron-bottom-small" viewBox="0 0 8 6">
      <path d="m1 1.5 3 3 3-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
    </svg></span>
    </div>
  </summary>

  <div class="accordion__content"><div class="prose"><div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p><strong>skytrakplus</strong></p><p>Select the STPLUS_XXXXXX network and enter the password: skytrakplus</p></div></div></div>
</details>
<details
  
  class=" accordion  group"
  aria-expanded="false"
  is="accordion-disclosure"
  
  
>
  <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><span
          
        >Quick Start Guide</span><span class="circle-chevron group-hover:colors group-expanded:colors group-expanded:rotate"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" width="8" height="6" class="icon icon-chevron-bottom-small" viewBox="0 0 8 6">
      <path d="m1 1.5 3 3 3-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
    </svg></span>
    </div>
  </summary>

  <div class="accordion__content"><div class="prose"><div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p>You can find the Quick Start Guide <a href="https://golftec.canto.com/pdfviewer/viewer/viewer.html?v=PFPRASLV1U&portalType=v%2FPFPRASLV1U&column=document&id=353lr3ghj95rj9sa695qo99j5c&suffix=pdf&print=1" target="_blank" title="Link to SkyTrak+ Launch Monitor Quick Start Guide"><strong>HERE</strong></a></p></div></div></div>
</details>
<details
  
  class=" accordion  group"
  aria-expanded="false"
  is="accordion-disclosure"
  
  
>
  <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><span
          
        >Safety and Product Information Guides</span><span class="circle-chevron group-hover:colors group-expanded:colors group-expanded:rotate"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" width="8" height="6" class="icon icon-chevron-bottom-small" viewBox="0 0 8 6">
      <path d="m1 1.5 3 3 3-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
    </svg></span>
    </div>
  </summary>

  <div class="accordion__content"><div class="prose"><div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p>Safety and Product Information Guide <a href="https://golftec.canto.com/pdfviewer/viewer/viewer.html?share=share%2Calbum%2CU0N78&column=document&id=s4hppiemu15qr83gvf0adnc62b&suffix=pdf&print=1" target="_blank" title="Safety Information guide for SkyTrak+"><strong>HERE</strong></a></p></div></div></div>
</details>
</div>
      </div><div
      
        class="lg:hidden"
      
    ><div class="faq-availability"><div class="v-stack gap-4"><img src="//www.skytrakgolf.com/cdn/shop/files/team.png?v=1711678384&amp;width=320" alt="SKYTRAK golf sim support team" srcset="//www.skytrakgolf.com/cdn/shop/files/team.png?v=1711678384&amp;width=160 160w, //www.skytrakgolf.com/cdn/shop/files/team.png?v=1711678384&amp;width=320 320w" width="320" height="90" loading="lazy" style="max-width: 160px" sizes="160px"></div>
<a class="button button--xl"
  
  
  
  
  
